OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FSunshine and showers in the north
OL,7,Fthroughout the period. Very hot
OL,8,Fsunshine further southeast midweek,
OL,9,Fthen less warm thereafter. Isolated
OL,10,Fshowers on Thursday, though staying
OL,11,Fmostly dry and settled here.
